OL,3,A'Quantity of petrol' but no explosives
OL,4,Afound in three vehicles near RAF
OL,5,AFairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FA quantity of petrol but no explosive
OL,8,Fdevices were found during searches of
OL,9,Fthe three vans near RAF Fairford in the
OL,10,Fwest of England, counter-terror police
OL,11,Fhave said.
OL,13,FFive men were arrested on suspicion of
OL,14,Fexplosives offences and later terrorism
OL,15,Foffences after the vehicles were
OL,16,Fspotted in the early hours of Sunday,
OL,17,Fsparking a major security incident
OL,18,Faround the base which is operated by
OL,19,Fthe US military.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
