OL,3,AMore than 400 detained as France
OL,4,Astudent protests escalate
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 400 people, mostly minors,
OL,7,Fwere detained in France on Tuesday over
OL,8,Fstudent protests at high schools across
OL,9,Fthe country, the French interior
OL,10,Fminister said.
OL,12,FThe demonstrations, which began in
OL,13,FParis and have seen teenagers blockade
OL,14,Ftheir schools for days, stem from
OL,15,Fissues including overcrowded classes
OL,16,Fand teacher shortages.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
