OL,3,AMore than 400 detained as France
OL,4,Astudent protests escalate
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 10 teachers and several
OL,7,Fstudents, as well as 48 law enforcement
OL,8,Fofficials, were injured during
OL,9,FTuesday's protests, officials said.
OL,10,FAccording to the education ministry, at
OL,11,Fleast 400 schools were affected.
OL,13,FPictures and videos appeared to show
OL,14,Fbins being set alight and bus stops
OL,15,Fdamaged by protesters.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
